{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL090aGVyc19MYW5ndWFnZS9Ib25nLUtvbmctTW92aWVzL0xhbiUyMEt3YWklMjBGb25nJTIwJTI4MjAxMSUyOS8","type":"movie","name":"Lan Kwai Fong","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/l5wPeAF5Vpsh3a5xAnmtxSrJ4LD.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/hVvwpsuCiv3JSXCzIVSG7HreBrn.jpg","description":"Lan Kwai Fong (LKF), a well-known party location in Hong Kong with loads of nightclubs and bars. Everyone likes to go to LKF for fun, one night stands or even true love. LKF has captured the joys and sorrows of many... One night, Steven - a regular of LKF met the flight attendant - Jennifer. They had sex on the first night they met but both could feel love come along. They had another date on New Year's Eve. Unfortunately, misunderstanding tore them apart and Jennifer decided to disappear from LKF. After eight months, Steven meets with Jennifer again and hopes to restart a relationship with her. However, Jennifer is no longer single, she's now his boss, Leslie's girlfriend. At the same time, Steven receives a call that his close friend collapsed and had to be sent to hospital. His friend encouraged him to follow his heart. When he finally decides to tell Jennifer about his feelings...\n\nReleased 15 Sept 2011 · Hong Kong · 97 min\nStudio: Local Production, Mei Ah Entertainment","releaseInfo":"2011","genres":["Drama","Others"],"imdbRating":"4.1","runtime":"97 min","cast":["Chen Zhi-Ming","Shiga Lin Si-Nga","Jeana Ho Pui-Yu","Jason Chan Pak-Yu","Dada Chan Ching","Gregory Wong Chung-yiu","Pal Sinn Lap-Man","Emme Wong Yi-Man"],"director":["Wilson Chin Kwok-wai"],"released":"2011-09-15T00:00:00.000Z","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Wilson Chin Kwok-wai","character":"Director","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/dbSRyHqNdFveM52e7ATXszQLfhC.jpg"},{"name":"Chen Zhi-Ming","character":"Steven","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/cZ7ILFY2bB7IXIlr2BZVFfSfhoQ.jpg"},{"name":"Shiga Lin Si-Nga","character":"Jennifer",